# Copy to .env.local for local development, or set in Vercel -> Settings -> Environment Variables.

# GitHub personal access token used for every server-side GitHub request.
# - A fine-grained token with NO extra permissions (public data only) is enough.
# - Required for /api/streak and /api/activity (the contribution calendar is GraphQL-only).
# - Without it GitHub allows 60 requests/hour for the whole deployment.
# Check what's left at any time: GET /api/status
GITHUB_TOKEN=
